            "body": "<p>Due to the nature of our products and for hygiene reasons, <strong>all sales are final.</strong> We do not accept returns, exchanges, or cancellations once an order has been placed.</p><p>Please carefully review your order before completing checkout to ensure you have selected the correct style, color, and quantity. If you have questions prior to purchasing, we encourage you to contact us before placing your order.</p>"
