            "body": "<p>Once an order has been submitted, it enters our processing system quickly and we are generally unable to make changes, additions, removals, or cancellations. Please verify your order carefully before completing checkout.</p><p><strong>First to checkout wins.</strong> Adding an item to your cart does not reserve inventory. When multiple customers attempt to purchase the same item, the first completed checkout will receive the available inventory.</p>"
