            "body": "<p><strong>Most orders ship the next business day.</strong> Please allow 1 to 3 business days for order processing, although many orders are shipped sooner. During major sales events, holidays, product launches, or periods of unusually high order volume, processing times may be slightly extended.</p><p>Once your order ships, tracking information will be provided by email. Please allow up to 24 to 48 hours for tracking updates to become active within the carrier's system.</p><p>Orders are shipped to the address provided during checkout. Once an order has been submitted, we are generally unable to modify shipping information or reroute packages.</p>"
