            "style": "default",
            "heading": "Sale and clearance items",
            "body": "<p>Sale, clearance, and promotional items may include overstock inventory or pieces that have been displayed, demonstrated, or tried on during educational live broadcasts. These items remain in excellent condition unless otherwise noted. However, they may not be factory-sealed or untouched.</p><p>If you want a brand-new, unopened item shipped directly from Belle Tress, please purchase regularly stocked merchandise rather than clearance or sale items.</p>"
